<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προανᾱλίσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.141
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ανάλωσα,</span> also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ανήλωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.834.3
				</span></i>
			:—<i>use up</i> or <i>spend before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνᾶν ἀργυρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					41.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π., ἵνα διπλάσια κομίσωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					19.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					59.18
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.τῆς γνώσεως ἑαυτούς,</span>
			i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸ τῆς γνώσεως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.517a
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>throw away one's life first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.81
			</span></i>; of water, <i>to be used up before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				349b11
			</span></i>.</div>
